<p><a href="https://littlefedi.org/index.html">littleFedi</a> is &quot;A small ActivityPub server written in Go&quot;</p>
<p>It was officially released (I think) yesterday, and is another project from <a href="https://my-notes.dragas.net/about/">Stefano Marinelli</a> of <a href="https://bssg.dragas.net/">BSSG</a> fame.</p>
<!-- more -->
<p>A few years ago I'd decided I wanted to &quot;own my content&quot; 🙄 so I ran an instance of Mastodon. Mastodon is overkill and I didn't enjoy it. Then, later, I installed an instance of <a href="https://gotosocial.org/">Go2Social</a>, which worked well. Trouble was, I was all-in with social media at the time and being on a single-user instance felt lonely...nothing useful in &quot;local&quot; or &quot;trending&quot;. Discovery was difficult. It was just me and I didn't like it.</p>
<p>Fast forward to today, and things have changed. I've deleted all of my Meta-related accounts and LinkedIn. I thought about quitting Mastodon as well, but FOMO always gets the better of me.</p>
<p>Since I would rather not quit Mastodon completely, I figured I would try running a single-user instance again. Maybe the quiet would be good for me.</p>
<p>I'd seen <a href="https://social.lol/@stefano@bsd.cafe">@Stefano</a>'s posts about a new ActivityPub server he was working on and the timing of the first release couldn't be better, so I installed it today at <a href="https://social.baty.net/">Jack Baty Social</a>.</p>
<p><img src="https://baty.net/img/2026/20261003-SCR-20261003-ofbt.png" alt="" /></p>
<p>It's running on my Hetzner VPS behind Caddy as a proxy. I love Caddy. Here's the entire Caddy config for the domain:</p>
<pre><code>social.baty.net {
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8081
}
</code></pre>
<p>I've just started poking around, but littleFedi seems like it's got a lot going for it. At first I wanted to use my root domain for my handle (<code>@jack@baty.net</code>) but since I'd previously used that via Ghost, I ran into caching issues and didn't want to bother, so now I'm <a href="https://social.baty.net/@jack">@jack@social.baty.net</a>.</p>
<p>The big question is whether to migrate followers there, or start fresh and maybe just announce the move from my main <a href="https://social.lol/@jbaty">@jbaty@social.lol</a> account. I think I'll give it a minute before deciding.</p>
<p>littleFedi is a compelling new entry in the FediverseSpaceArena.</p>
